    blurb: "Why LLMs produce confident falsehoods, the kinds of hallucination, measuring them, and the layered mitigations: grounding and citations, abstention and uncertainty, verification and self-consistency checks, constrained outputs, and input/output guardrails with policy classifiers.",
    signals: ["\"How do you reduce hallucinations?\"", "\"Design guardrails for a customer-facing assistant\"", "\"How would the model say it doesn't know?\"", "Trust and safety sections of GenAI designs"],
